# VHS tape: modkeel status demo
# Run with: vhs demo/status.tape
# Requires: modkeel installed (no token needed)

Output demo/status.gif
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "modkeel --version"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "modkeel status"
Enter
Sleep 3s
